  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lemaidher Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support and organize marketing circuits by setting up means of packaging (solar freezers) and transport; build shelters, a store, a water basin to create conditions for the development of livestock breeding; set up a revolving fund for the purchase of very good breeds of goats and camels, an initial endowment of animal feed, the purchase of members&apos; production up to 70%, build the capacities of members by carrying out a series of training courses.</narrative>
  </description>
